  lines:
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: I don't know who you think you are, but if you're going to spread war, then Mazinger will be there to protect everyone from you!
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4eaa01649e68c3e4bb9a59c04a541ec4, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Your heroics make you see everything only in black and white. A curse, but also your greatest strength.
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: How about you stay quite about philosophy and get Rocket Punched!
    showPortrait: 1
